normal save :
	git add .
	git commit -m "comment"
	git push


tag version : git tag vx.y
recall version : git checkout vx.y

merge :
git checkout main
git pull origin main
git checkout main
git merge branch-test
git push origin main

delete local : git branch -d test_branch
delete remote : git push origin --delete test_branch

list last commits :
git log --oneline

versionning using git :
close current version git tag v0.4
start new git checkout -b v0.5
close current version git tag v0.5
...